 <p>Resolves both direct Codex high-risk Critic hosts from valid V3 duty authority plus an optional trusted current-session role receipt. Missing or malformed optional selection retains the V3 route; a selected model changes the bound source digest so selected/native packet readback detects receipt drift. A native selection prepared elsewhere must use this exact route; its producer is not supplied by this resolver.</p>
